     ssmmaarrttppqqii — Microchip Smart Storage SCSI driver

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     To compile this driver into the kernel, place these lines in the kernel
     configuration file:

           ddeevviiccee ppccii
           ddeevviiccee ssccbbuuss
           ddeevviiccee ssmmaarrttppqqii

     The driver can be loaded as a module at boot time by placing this line in
     loader.conf(5):

           smartpqi_load="YES"

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ssmmaarrttppqqii driver provides support for Microchip Technology Inc. /
     Adaptec SmartRaid and SmartHBA SATA/SAS/NVME PCIe controllers

HHAARRDDWWAARREE
     Controllers supported by the ssmmaarrttppqqii driver include, but not limited to:

     ••   HPE Gen10 Smart Array Controller Family
     ••   Adaptec SmartRaid and SmartHBA Controllers
     ••   OEM Controllers based on the Microchip Technology Inc. SmartROC and
         SmartIOC Chipsets

